(text "Pins 101-130 = H1 pin 1-30, 201-230 = H2 pin 1-30.\nPPU on GP0-17, IRQ/CIRAM/OE#/CVBS on GP18-24,\nCPU on GP25-43, I2C 44/45, audio 46, spare 47.\nGP40-47 (ADC, NOT 5V tolerant): AHCT inputs / 3V3 parts only.\nModule: LIFT R16 (GP23 KEY), never fit PSRAM U7 (CS = GP0).\nGP25 drives the module LED via 5.1k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 175 80 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb0fd394-86ed-5d2b-9d0e-260631fd38c9"))
